CORE
main.c
--winx64
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
Visual Studio (checked with MSVC 19 for x64) does not let __declspec(align(n))
reduce an alignment, and uses the last of several align declspecs (warning
C4141). goto-cc instead reduced the alignment of objects and typedefs, and used
the largest of several align declspecs.
